### Shared requests for both apps.
### Run from IntelliJ (built-in HTTP client) or VS Code (REST Client extension).

@java = http://localhost:8080
@python = http://localhost:8000

### Java (Spring Boot) health
GET {{java}}/health

### Python (FastAPI) health
GET {{python}}/health

### Java app info (Actuator /info)
GET {{java}}/info

### Python OpenAPI document (what /docs is built from)
GET {{python}}/openapi.json
